{'symbol': 'TSCO', 'date': '2023-02-09 16:15:00', 'title': 'TRACTOR SUPPLY ANNOUNCES THREE-YEAR CONTRACT EXTENSION FOR PRESIDENT AND CEO HAL LAWTON AND BOARD SUCCESSION PLANS', 'text': "BRENTWOOD, TENN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #4H--TRACTOR SUPPLY COMPANY (NASDAQ: TSCO), THE LARGEST RURAL LIFESTYLE RETAILER IN THE UNITED STATES, ANNOUNCED THE EXTENSION OF PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER HAL LAWTON'S EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT AND KEY TRANSITIONS ON ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS. THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS ELECTED LONG-STANDING MEMBER EDNA MORRIS AS CHAIRMAN OF THE BOARD."}